Intent: evaluate_update_policy ignores weak_attempt, so a pin_and_verify policy carrying a waive flag (auto_update, skip_verify_on_update) passes.
Property: a waive flag in the update policy is DENY (update_policy_rejected) even when the mode itself is pin_and_verify.
--- a/supply_gate/update_policy.py
+++ b/supply_gate/update_policy.py
@@ -159,7 +159,7 @@ def evaluate_update_policy(
         return (DenyReason.UPDATE_POLICY_REJECTED,)
     if policy is None:
         return ()
-    if weak_attempt or not policy.accepted():
+    if not policy.accepted():
         return (DenyReason.UPDATE_POLICY_REJECTED,)
     return ()
 
